    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bff86f77fc9a58c4d8e772ccb77a13c3,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Orderly
    <Description>k__BackingField: Healing received from all sources is doubled.
