    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Quality shoes
    <Description>k__BackingField: Movement speed increases by 15%.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 29d26b5186befda448b70fcbe49a1984,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Surprise
    <Description>k__BackingField: 10% chance to knock out, when killing an enemy,
      additional coins or a charge for an additional skill.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 52a012f84f61811418680ceea7a0654e,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Hidden Treasures
    <Description>k__BackingField: The chance of finding coins or crystals in breakable
      objects increases. The chance of finding everything else is lower.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 52a012f84f61811418680ceea7a0654e,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Expect good things
    <Description>k__BackingField: The first shot after every 3 seconds will be critical.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 149a88e5113f26d47b58af943b34df02,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Vampire
    <Description>k__BackingField: Attacks restore 1 unit of health, if health is
      full, armor is restored. Attacks deal 50% less damage.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4bcee6ed11e12c41bd534b0e9b62c7d,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Boxer
    <Description>k__BackingField: The chance of inflicting critical damage on an
      enemy standing less than 5 meters away doubles.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 149a88e5113f26d47b58af943b34df02,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Bullet light
    <Description>k__BackingField: Reloading consumes twice as much ammo (primarily
      due to unused types of ammunition). Critical hit chance increases by 25%.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 149a88e5113f26d47b58af943b34df02,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Tactical reloading
    <Description>k__BackingField: During reloading, movement speed increases by 25%
      and damage taken is reduced by 10%.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 29d26b5186befda448b70fcbe49a1984,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Love of life
    <Description>k__BackingField: After receiving damage, 3 health units are restored
      over 5 seconds.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4bcee6ed11e12c41bd534b0e9b62c7d,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Bad hand
    <Description>k__BackingField: If you have additional skill charges, deal 75%
      more damage, and if you don't have them, deal 25% less damage.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 654f1188d88eeeb4ba5934f5755e41a0,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Grudge
    <Description>k__BackingField: When receiving damage, your own damage increases
      by 15% for 5 seconds.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 654f1188d88eeeb4ba5934f5755e41a0,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Second chance
    <Description>k__BackingField: When receiving lethal damage, restore 10% of your
      maximum health. The skill disappears after triggering.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e45be0352c903054882af767cfe418f4,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Dead soul
    <Description>k__BackingField: Having received lethal damage, become invulnerable
      for 5 seconds, if during this time you do not replenish your health, you will
      die. The skill disappears after triggering.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e45be0352c903054882af767cfe418f4,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Paranormal
    <Description>k__BackingField: Maximum health drops to 1 unit. The amount of armor
      triples.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faad892b38ea694439d0609a7cc57619,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Live meat
    <Description>k__BackingField: Every second, 4% of your maximum health is converted
      into missing armor. As a result of using the ability, health cannot fall below
      20%.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faad892b38ea694439d0609a7cc57619,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Rescuer
    <Description>k__BackingField: After receiving lethal damage, restore 10% of your
      health, if within 5 seconds after the ability is triggered you do not kill
      a single enemy, you will die. The skill disappears after triggering.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faad892b38ea694439d0609a7cc57619,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Bloody ammunition
    <Description>k__BackingField: When the magazine is empty, you continue to fire,
      dealing 2% more damage per shot, and losing 1% of your maximum health per shot.
      It is possible to die as a result of using a skill.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 654f1188d88eeeb4ba5934f5755e41a0,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Stock
    <Description>k__BackingField: Lose 50% of your maximum armor and 50% of your
      maximum health. Gain 2 extra lives.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e45be0352c903054882af767cfe418f4,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Anemia
    <Description>k__BackingField: Maximum health is doubled. Take 10% more damage
      from all sources.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f4bcee6ed11e12c41bd534b0e9b62c7d,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Discipline
    <Description>k__BackingField: Every second, the chance of a critical shot increases
      by 5%. Resets after landing a critical shot.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 149a88e5113f26d47b58af943b34df02,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Giant Slayer
    <Description>k__BackingField: 5% chance that when an enemy takes damage, 5% of
      their maximum health will be converted into bonus damage.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 654f1188d88eeeb4ba5934f5755e41a0,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Alien energy
    <Description>k__BackingField: 50% chance to restore 5 armor when killing an enemy.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faad892b38ea694439d0609a7cc57619,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Lightning
    <Description>k__BackingField: The faster your current speed, the higher your
      resistance to damage received. Maximum 30%.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faad892b38ea694439d0609a7cc57619,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Extravagance
    <Description>k__BackingField: +10% to damage resistance for every 100 ammo spent.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faad892b38ea694439d0609a7cc57619,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Miner
    <Description>k__BackingField: The reward for killing enemies within 7 meters
      is twice as high.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 52a012f84f61811418680ceea7a0654e,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Veteran
    <Description>k__BackingField: +1 to maximum health for each enemy killed up to
      7 meters away.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 654f1188d88eeeb4ba5934f5755e41a0,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Eggshell
    <Description>k__BackingField: Gain an additional 15% damage resistance while
      wearing armor. Become 15% vulnerable to damage when not armored.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faad892b38ea694439d0609a7cc57619,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Speed
    <Description>k__BackingField: Movement speed is 50% higher, the main skill is
      restored 150% longer.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 29d26b5186befda448b70fcbe49a1984,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: The limit of what's possible
    <Description>k__BackingField: The additional skill can be used even when there
      are no projectiles, for each such use you will receive 25 points of damage.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b60a62368b1f6334ba6e9cd62c3c9bd6,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Sleeping bullet
    <Description>k__BackingField: The less ammo left in the magazine, the higher
      the weapon's damage (maximum +75%).
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 654f1188d88eeeb4ba5934f5755e41a0,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Two sides of the coin
    <Description>k__BackingField: Alternate between Yin and Yang states every 12
      seconds. The Yin state gives +20% to damage resistance, and the Yang state
      gives +50% to damage dealt.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4f930a79624f75a45986a1219e34d7f3,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Double-edged sword
    <Description>k__BackingField: For each enemy defeated, gain +1% damage and -0.5%
      damage resistance.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 654f1188d88eeeb4ba5934f5755e41a0,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Fury
    <Description>k__BackingField: When receiving damage, you will receive +20% chance
      to deal critical damage for 5 seconds.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 149a88e5113f26d47b58af943b34df02,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Golden armor
    <Description>k__BackingField: When using an additional skill, restore 5% of your
      armor from its maximum.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faad892b38ea694439d0609a7cc57619,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Grace
    <Description>k__BackingField: Reduce damage resistance by 100%, but damage taken
      cannot exceed 10% of maximum health.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: faad892b38ea694439d0609a7cc57619,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: All or nothing
    <Description>k__BackingField: Gain 100% damage. Lose 75% of your maximum health.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 654f1188d88eeeb4ba5934f5755e41a0,
      type: 3}
    <BackgroundColor>k__BackingField: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
    <Opened>k__BackingField: 0
  - <Name>k__BackingField: Penetrating projectile
    <Description>k__BackingField: Critical attacks penetrate enemy armor.
    <Sprite>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 149a88e5113f26d47b58af943b34df02,
